{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2022-12-19 16:05:00', 'title': 'MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL ANNOUNCES COMPLETION OF THE SALE OF THE OPERATIONS OF THE MIRAGE', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS , DEC. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL (NYSE: MGM) ("MGM RESORTS" OR THE "COMPANY") TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS CLOSED ON THE SALE OF THE OPERATIONS OF THE MIRAGE HOTEL & CASINO ("THE MIRAGE") TO HARD ROCK INTERNATIONAL ("HARD ROCK") FOR $1.075 BILLION IN CASH. "MIRAGE EMPLOYEES HAVE DELIVERED UNPARALLELED SERVICE AND EXPERIENCES OVER THE PAST THREE DECADES, AND WE ARE FOREVER THANKFUL FOR THEIR WORK TO MAKE THE MIRAGE SUCH AN ICONIC, WORLD-CLASS DESTINATION," SAID BILL HORNBUCKLE, CEO & PRESIDENT, MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL.'}{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2022-12-19 14:00:00', 'title': 'BETMGM NAMED AN OFFICIAL SPORTS BETTING PARTNER OF NASHVILLE PREDATORS', 'text': 'MULTI-YEAR PARTNERSHIP INCLUDES A BETMGM-BRANDED RESTAURANT AND SIGNAGE AT BRIDGESTONE ARENA NASHVILLE, TENN. , DEC. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BETMGM, A LEADING SPORTS BETTING AND IGAMING OPERATOR, ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY NOW IS AN OFFICIAL SPORTS BETTING PARTNER OF THE NASHVILLE PREDATORS.'}{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2022-12-19 09:00:00', 'title': 'MGM RESORTS ANNOUNCES MGM GRAND PARADISE AWARDED NEW 10 YEAR GAMING CONCESSION CONTRACT', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS , DEC. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL (NYSE: MGM) ("MGM RESORTS" OR THE "COMPANY") ANNOUNCED THAT MGM GRAND PARADISE THE CONCESSION HOLDER OF MGM CHINA HOLDINGS LTD. (2282 HK), WHICH IS 56% OWNED BY MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL, HAS BEEN AWARDED A NEW 10-YEAR GAMING CONCESSION CONTRACT.'}